# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Photo Relay — repository hygiene
#
# The Python engine in sync_engine/ IS the project and is tracked. What stays
# out of Git is personal data: run logs, watermarks, device identifiers, and
# machine-specific configuration.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local runtime data written by the desktop app.
runtime/*
!runtime/.gitkeep

# Machine-specific configuration. Copy config.example.json to config.json.
config.local.json
sync_engine/config.json

# Run logs and transfer state — these contain device UDIDs and personal paths.
sync_engine/logs/
sync_engine/*.log
sync_engine/sync_state.json
sync_engine/**/sync_state.json
sync_engine/termux_package/sync_state.json

# Python caches and editor backups.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak_*
sync_engine/.DS_Store

# Build artifacts and dependencies.
node_modules/
dist/
target/
apps/desktop/node_modules/
apps/desktop/dist/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large re-downloadable binaries
#
# apps/t3-server-android/ holds real source (shell, Java, build scripts) that
# is worth backing up, but it also carried a full Android SDK and several
# APKs. Together with the Rust build output that is ~5 GB, and GitHub hard
# rejects any single file over 100 MB. None of it is authored here: the SDK
# and APKs come from their upstreams and are reproducible from build-app.sh.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
apps/t3-server-android/android-sdk/
apps/t3-server-android/out/
apps/t3-server-android/*.apk
apps/t3-server-android/*.idsig
apps/t3-server-android/*.tar.gz
apps/t3-server-android/*.tar.xz
apps/t3-server-android/*.zip
apps/t3-server-android/node-*
# Stock Android debug keystore. build-app.sh regenerates it on line 24 if
# missing, so there is no reason to version a private key file.
apps/t3-server-android/*.keystore
apps/t3-server-android/*.jks
apps/desktop/branding/*.tar.gz
apps/desktop/branding/*.tgz
design/**/*.png
ember-sheet-test.png